WEBVTT

01:30.430 --> 01:34.990
[The Heir]

01:35.400 --> 01:37.940
[Episode 17]

01:38.120 --> 01:39.680
You are just a merchant.

01:39.680 --> 01:41.880
How can you act on behalf of His Majesty?

01:43.200 --> 01:46.920
Qi Jiu, your action is truly overstepping.

01:47.200 --> 01:47.950
Besides,

01:48.509 --> 01:51.229
normally, if a commoner
wants to report an official,

01:51.229 --> 01:53.890
they either file a petition
on the day of filing,

01:54.039 --> 01:55.640
or beat the drum of grievance.

01:55.640 --> 01:57.560
You did neither of these.

01:59.070 --> 01:59.840
Qi Jiu,

02:01.350 --> 02:04.400
you are seriously not taking
His Majesty's rules

02:04.400 --> 02:05.710
seriously.

02:06.200 --> 02:07.040
Lord He.

02:08.150 --> 02:10.430
Zhao Shen is the magistrate of She County.

02:10.430 --> 02:12.800
Both of those options
must go through him.

02:13.630 --> 02:15.870
If I were to alert him

02:16.030 --> 02:17.690
and he destroys the evidence,

02:17.960 --> 02:20.590
the truth will never come to light.

02:20.960 --> 02:22.870
Moreover, you may not know this.

02:23.120 --> 02:25.310
We are in Huizhou
under Marshal Qi's orders

02:25.310 --> 02:27.110
to purchase military supplies.

02:27.470 --> 02:30.280
What I am doing
is also to rid the people of an evil.

02:30.520 --> 02:31.870
And as far as I know,

02:32.310 --> 02:35.079
you have always been just and upright,

02:35.240 --> 02:37.560
never associating
with those corrupt officials

02:37.560 --> 02:38.590
in the court.

02:38.800 --> 02:40.360
Isn't that so, Lord He?

02:42.960 --> 02:44.470
Of course.

02:45.710 --> 02:47.150
I didn't expect you

02:47.680 --> 02:50.150
to have such an identity.

02:50.590 --> 02:53.120
It was my oversight.

02:53.360 --> 02:54.490
Apologies for that.

02:56.120 --> 02:56.920
Rest assured.

02:57.240 --> 03:00.470
I will carefully investigate this case

03:00.710 --> 03:03.870
and give you
and Marshal Qi an explanation.

03:09.470 --> 03:10.590
Thank you, Lord He.

03:13.380 --> 03:19.910
[Zhao's Mansion]

03:21.710 --> 03:22.310
My Lord.

03:22.360 --> 03:23.030
My Lord.

03:23.870 --> 03:25.600
Who's in charge of this place's

03:25.710 --> 03:26.840
accounting?

03:29.079 --> 03:29.910
I am.

03:31.360 --> 03:32.240
You?

03:34.400 --> 03:35.240
Well, My Lord.

03:36.470 --> 03:38.910
She is the eldest daughter
of the Tian family.

03:38.910 --> 03:41.910
I am Xu Chengde,
the accountant of Tian Ink Workshop.

03:42.590 --> 03:43.590
How can I help you?

03:44.560 --> 03:46.220
Where is the accounting room?

03:46.400 --> 03:47.600
It's in the backyard.

03:49.120 --> 03:49.800
Listen!

03:49.840 --> 03:50.840
Take him away.

03:51.310 --> 03:52.310
You two, go inside

03:52.310 --> 03:53.560
and take all the ledgers.

03:53.560 --> 03:54.120
Wh-What's going on?

03:54.120 --> 03:54.750
Wait, My Lord.

03:54.750 --> 03:56.800
What law has our family broken?

03:57.030 --> 03:57.890
You don't know?

03:58.400 --> 04:00.630
Colluding with corrupt official Zhao Shen
to seize private houses.

04:00.630 --> 04:03.240
Secretly colluding with banks
to make a profit from loans.

04:03.240 --> 04:04.360
These things,

04:04.560 --> 04:06.890
Miss Tian, you should know better than us.

04:08.710 --> 04:10.000
Lord He has ordered

04:10.030 --> 04:12.400
to arrest the three men
of the Tian family.

04:12.800 --> 04:14.430
As for the accountant
and the account books,

04:14.430 --> 04:16.120
they will be taken
to the government office and detained.

04:16.120 --> 04:18.510
You should probably
close your store today.

04:18.510 --> 04:21.430
Let's see how
Lord He's investigation goes.

04:21.430 --> 04:22.040
Take them away!

04:22.040 --> 04:23.000
My Lord.

04:23.000 --> 04:24.310
Mr. Xu!

04:24.750 --> 04:26.190
My Lord! My Lord!

04:26.190 --> 04:26.790
My Lord...

04:34.270 --> 04:34.480
Go!

04:34.480 --> 04:35.310
Lightly!

04:35.390 --> 04:35.680
Hurry up!

04:35.680 --> 04:36.360
That hurt!

04:36.510 --> 04:37.360
Hurry up!

04:37.390 --> 04:38.510
Mind your manners!

04:38.510 --> 04:39.510
Behave yourself!

04:40.950 --> 04:41.800
Master!

04:42.190 --> 04:42.850
Don't move.

04:49.920 --> 04:50.510
Father!

04:50.630 --> 04:51.290
Don't move.

04:51.430 --> 04:52.070
Father!

04:52.630 --> 04:53.270
Father.

04:53.720 --> 04:54.950
What is going on here?

04:55.070 --> 04:55.800
Daughter,

04:55.950 --> 04:58.040
you've seen what's going on?

04:58.560 --> 04:59.890
The Tian family is over.

05:00.160 --> 05:02.360
Only you can save me

05:02.630 --> 05:04.000
and your two brothers.

05:04.000 --> 05:04.920
Cut the crap.

05:05.000 --> 05:05.390
Take him away!

05:05.390 --> 05:05.870
What's going on?

05:05.870 --> 05:06.240
Go!

05:06.240 --> 05:07.300
-Master!
-Father!

05:07.390 --> 05:08.310
Master!

05:08.870 --> 05:09.560
Get back.

05:09.750 --> 05:10.480
Mother!

05:14.040 --> 05:15.040
What's going on?

05:15.430 --> 05:16.190
Sister!

05:16.830 --> 05:18.230
The men of the Tian family

05:18.390 --> 05:20.160
have been taken away by the guards.

05:20.160 --> 05:21.720
I've been waiting for this day...

05:21.720 --> 05:23.510
for way too long.

05:23.920 --> 05:25.120
I know.

05:25.390 --> 05:26.650
Look how happy you are.

05:26.720 --> 05:27.270
Come.

05:28.680 --> 05:29.270
Sister,

05:30.270 --> 05:31.600
thank you for

05:31.920 --> 05:33.380
bearing with me recently.

05:33.390 --> 05:34.360
Today, substituting tea for wine,

05:34.360 --> 05:35.360
I toast you.

05:38.000 --> 05:39.480
Good tea, as expected.

05:39.950 --> 05:41.270
Every time I drink tea with you,

05:41.270 --> 05:43.000
I feel my good tea is wasted.

05:43.830 --> 05:44.630
I'm happy.

05:45.600 --> 05:46.560
So happy.

05:47.390 --> 05:50.070
The Tian family's father and sons
have been taken away by the government.

05:50.070 --> 05:51.720
They are now trapped.

05:51.950 --> 05:54.240
You can finally consider yourself avenged.

05:54.240 --> 05:55.630
I am happy for you too.

05:56.750 --> 05:59.120
Now, you should be at ease

05:59.190 --> 06:00.850
and focus on proper business.

06:01.920 --> 06:02.830
Yes.

06:04.830 --> 06:08.360
But a centipede dies hard.

06:09.600 --> 06:11.660
I'm only worried that the Tian family

06:12.240 --> 06:13.430
has a backup plan.

06:23.430 --> 06:24.390
Ronghua, what should we do?

06:24.390 --> 06:25.870
You have to think of a way.

06:26.120 --> 06:27.360
Your father and brother are in trouble.

06:27.360 --> 06:29.040
What will we do in the future?

06:29.680 --> 06:32.240
We must find a way
to save your father and brothers.

06:32.240 --> 06:33.720
Nothing can happen to them.

06:33.720 --> 06:35.000
If something happens to them,

06:35.000 --> 06:36.480
how will the two of us live?

06:37.600 --> 06:39.800
I've been helping in the accounting room
these past few years.

06:39.800 --> 06:41.830
The Tian family's accounts
are clear and detailed—

06:41.830 --> 06:43.310
I handled them all too.

06:43.680 --> 06:46.480
They have absolutely nothing to do
with Zhao Shen.

06:48.270 --> 06:50.800
Have you forgotten
what your father told you?

06:51.510 --> 06:52.800
The accounts you made

06:53.000 --> 06:54.920
can only fool idiots.

06:55.120 --> 06:56.830
Do you think with your accounts,

06:56.830 --> 06:59.430
we are able to top Hui Ink?

07:01.480 --> 07:02.240
Mother...

07:03.680 --> 07:05.010
What do you mean by that?

07:10.240 --> 07:11.500
Have you forgotten how

07:11.950 --> 07:13.360
the Luo family fell?

07:14.190 --> 07:15.650
After the Luo family fell,

07:15.750 --> 07:16.950
how their belongings

07:17.120 --> 07:20.000
were sent to Lord Zhao's mansion?

07:21.270 --> 07:23.600
And how the official silver
over the years

07:24.120 --> 07:25.680
smoothly ended up

07:25.870 --> 07:27.430
in his pockets?

07:28.750 --> 07:30.550
Every single one of these things

07:30.560 --> 07:31.630
could cost

07:31.750 --> 07:34.390
your father and brothers their heads.

07:40.390 --> 07:41.159
Ronghua.

07:42.430 --> 07:43.070
Ronghua.

07:44.390 --> 07:46.070
We must think of a way.

07:46.720 --> 07:49.480
We have to save your father and brothers.

07:50.070 --> 07:52.190
If they really can't come back,

07:53.040 --> 07:56.240
I really don't know how I'll live.

07:56.800 --> 07:59.680
Ronghua, please save them.

08:00.270 --> 08:03.480
Your father and brothers
cannot be in trouble,

08:03.800 --> 08:05.430
do you understand?

08:08.160 --> 08:09.830
Save them.

08:11.270 --> 08:12.800
Master!

08:13.920 --> 08:14.680
Ronghua...

08:14.750 --> 08:15.680
Stop crying.

08:20.920 --> 08:22.120
I said stop crying.

08:25.480 --> 08:27.360
Th-There is a way?

08:32.630 --> 08:33.669
Pack our things.

08:37.270 --> 08:38.799
We're going to the capital.

08:39.200 --> 08:39.960
Really?

08:42.240 --> 08:44.030
Ronghua, you are agreeing?

08:45.840 --> 08:46.390
Okay.

08:47.510 --> 08:49.170
I will pack our bags right now.

08:51.790 --> 08:52.390
Go,

08:52.840 --> 08:54.170
pack young lady's bags.

09:01.750 --> 09:02.440
Zhen.

09:02.600 --> 09:03.200
Zhen.

09:03.810 --> 09:04.520
Something happened.

09:04.520 --> 09:05.370
What's wrong, Mother?

09:05.370 --> 09:06.910
I just went to Butcher Zhang's
to buy meat.

09:06.910 --> 09:08.270
I heard something happened
to the Tian family.

09:08.270 --> 09:09.790
Tian Ink Workshop was sealed off.

09:09.790 --> 09:11.320
Tian Huai'an and his sons

09:11.320 --> 09:12.600
were also taken to the yamen together.

09:12.600 --> 09:13.600
Mother, take your time.

09:13.600 --> 09:14.670
What happened?

09:15.120 --> 09:17.320
I just went around
to Tian Ink Workshop to take a look.

09:17.320 --> 09:19.320
There were official seals
on its doors.

09:19.320 --> 09:21.000
I also heard

09:21.120 --> 09:22.840
they took away an accountant.

09:23.000 --> 09:24.150
Who else did they take?

09:24.150 --> 09:25.720
What about Ronghua? Is she okay?

09:25.720 --> 09:26.870
I don't think it was Ronghua.

09:26.870 --> 09:28.550
I heard it was an old man

09:28.550 --> 09:29.440
surnamed Xu.

09:32.030 --> 09:33.840
Mother, please keep an eye
on the ink workshop for me.

09:33.840 --> 09:35.040
I'll go find Ronghua.

09:37.390 --> 09:38.480
Zhen, slow down!

09:40.300 --> 09:49.570
[Changsheng Garden]

09:47.410 --> 09:47.910
Where is Ronghua?

09:47.910 --> 09:48.840
Where is your lady?

09:48.840 --> 09:49.640
You're finally here.

09:49.640 --> 09:51.480
My Lady is going to marry
the dumb grandson

09:51.480 --> 09:53.080
of the Capital's Lord Xu.

09:53.200 --> 09:54.790
Go and persuade her!

09:55.030 --> 09:56.000
Is she inside?

09:56.000 --> 09:56.720
She is.

10:05.750 --> 10:06.510
Ronghua!

10:06.720 --> 10:07.440
Ronghua!

10:07.720 --> 10:08.600
Zhen.

10:09.150 --> 10:10.480
What's going on?

10:11.150 --> 10:11.870
Zhen.

10:12.480 --> 10:13.880
I'm going to the Capital.

10:13.960 --> 10:14.910
The Capital?

10:15.870 --> 10:17.790
Are you really going to marry Lord Xu's

10:17.790 --> 10:19.120
dumb grandson?

10:21.630 --> 10:22.510
No.

10:22.960 --> 10:24.890
You can't ruin your life like this.

10:29.150 --> 10:30.870
There's no other way.

10:32.270 --> 10:33.440
Three years ago,

10:33.630 --> 10:35.630
our family rose to power
by stepping on the Luo family,

10:35.630 --> 10:37.230
growing bigger step by step.

10:37.270 --> 10:38.360
Three years later,

10:39.390 --> 10:41.790
our ink workshop's raided
for a crime we committed.

10:41.790 --> 10:44.390
My father and brothers
will be punished by law.

10:44.720 --> 10:45.510
Maybe...

10:47.080 --> 10:48.960
this is the Tian family's retribution.

10:48.960 --> 10:50.440
They deserve it.

10:50.720 --> 10:51.840
They may deserve it,

10:51.840 --> 10:53.390
but not you.

10:55.240 --> 10:57.000
I'm also a member of the Tian family.

10:57.000 --> 10:58.390
Since something happened
to the Tian family,

10:58.390 --> 10:59.990
what good could happen to me?

11:01.750 --> 11:04.390
Zhen, I've envied you since we were kids.

11:04.870 --> 11:06.030
When we were little,

11:06.200 --> 11:09.130
you were the young lady
spoiled by your whole family.

11:09.510 --> 11:11.710
Later, even when your family declined,

11:11.720 --> 11:14.630
your grandfather, your brother,
and your mother

11:14.840 --> 11:17.000
still treated you with all their hearts.

11:17.000 --> 11:18.600
No matter what you want to do,

11:18.600 --> 11:20.960
you can achieve it
as long as you work hard.

11:21.270 --> 11:22.600
No matter what happens,

11:22.960 --> 11:24.550
you can fight to the end.

11:25.510 --> 11:28.030
Ronghua, you can do it too.

11:28.360 --> 11:29.150
Don't worry.

11:29.200 --> 11:30.030
With me around,

11:30.030 --> 11:32.230
no one can force you to go to the Capital.

11:33.670 --> 11:34.480
Zhen.

11:35.480 --> 11:36.720
I'm not forced to go

11:37.000 --> 11:38.400
to the Capital this time.

11:39.000 --> 11:40.390
I am doing it willingly.

11:46.600 --> 11:47.480
Ronghua...

11:48.600 --> 11:50.330
You better think this through.

11:50.670 --> 11:51.800
Going to the Capital

11:52.080 --> 11:54.540
is bound to be
jumping into another fire pit.

11:55.480 --> 11:56.440
Even if it's a fire pit,

11:56.440 --> 11:57.700
I have to jump in there.

11:58.910 --> 12:00.080
I can't just watch

12:00.080 --> 12:02.360
my father and brothers lose their lives.

12:15.390 --> 12:16.200
Ronghua.

12:18.630 --> 12:19.390
Zhen.

12:20.240 --> 12:21.700
You have your path to take,

12:22.000 --> 12:23.480
and I have mine.

12:24.480 --> 12:25.600
This is my fate.

12:26.390 --> 12:27.440
I accept it.

12:29.440 --> 12:30.670
After today,

12:32.000 --> 12:34.080
we may never see each other again.

12:34.910 --> 12:35.840
May everything

12:36.360 --> 12:37.960
go well for you in the future.

12:38.600 --> 12:40.150
Never be like me—

12:40.960 --> 12:42.490
bowing your head to others.

12:43.030 --> 12:44.630
Ronghua, it's time to go.

12:44.910 --> 12:45.670
Ronghua.

12:48.720 --> 12:49.480
Ronghua.

12:52.000 --> 12:52.790
Ronghua!

13:15.400 --> 13:17.510
[Post]

13:35.440 --> 13:36.200
Zhao Shen,

13:37.030 --> 13:37.960
Lord Zhao.

13:41.080 --> 13:42.910
I am here to see you off.

13:49.030 --> 13:49.910
Master Qi.

13:51.080 --> 13:53.720
You and I have no enmity
in the past or present.

13:54.550 --> 13:56.270
Why are you causing me demise?

13:56.480 --> 13:57.910
I'm causing you demise?

14:01.670 --> 14:02.670
Lord Zhao,

14:03.840 --> 14:05.640
if you want to talk about demise,

14:06.090 --> 14:08.450
you only have yourself to blame.

14:09.790 --> 14:12.390
You can only blame the fact
that over the years,

14:12.440 --> 14:15.030
you've gotten too close
to the Tian family.

14:17.000 --> 14:17.960
Lord Zhao.

14:19.240 --> 14:21.390
Go to Jinling and await your execution.

14:21.390 --> 14:22.080
You

14:22.840 --> 14:25.030
and the father and sons
of the Tian family—

14:25.030 --> 14:26.960
none of you will escape.

14:38.750 --> 14:39.270
You!

14:41.320 --> 14:41.870
You...

14:42.150 --> 14:42.840
Xiao Qi.

14:58.340 --> 15:01.150
[Capital, Hu's Mansion]

15:07.100 --> 15:09.260
Smile.

15:09.290 --> 15:11.270
[Lord Xu's grandson, Hu Qi]

15:09.440 --> 15:11.960
Smile. Father, smile.

15:13.120 --> 15:15.150
[Lord Xu's daughter, Xu Wan]

15:13.270 --> 15:15.270
Are you getting used to the Capital?

15:15.960 --> 15:16.840
Yes, yes.

15:16.910 --> 15:17.910
Thank you, Madam.

15:20.610 --> 15:22.180
Qi, be good.

15:22.960 --> 15:23.720
Massage.

15:24.040 --> 15:25.710
Young Master is quite lively.

15:26.990 --> 15:27.680
Qi.

15:27.730 --> 15:28.820
Be careful.

15:29.510 --> 15:30.200
Mother.

15:30.440 --> 15:31.270
Qi,

15:30.770 --> 15:32.700
[Lord Xu's son-in-law, Hu Shiyuan]

15:31.910 --> 15:32.790
be good.

15:37.120 --> 15:37.720
Eat.

15:37.720 --> 15:39.790
There's a lot of meat on the table,

15:40.160 --> 15:41.510
eat more.

15:42.000 --> 15:43.000
Thank you, Madam.

15:44.440 --> 15:45.080
Ronghua,

15:45.320 --> 15:47.600
it's a blessing of three lifetimes

15:47.720 --> 15:49.670
for us to marry into the Hu family.

15:50.670 --> 15:53.600
The Madam and the Lord are so good to us,

15:54.120 --> 15:56.380
and Young Master is also a fine young man.

15:56.550 --> 15:58.350
After you marry into the family,

15:58.630 --> 16:01.030
you must be doubly considerate
to your husband,

16:01.030 --> 16:01.870
understand?

16:06.200 --> 16:06.840
Madam.

16:07.550 --> 16:09.550
Ronghua is a good child.

16:10.390 --> 16:13.520
I think she and Young Master
are destined for each other.

16:14.120 --> 16:15.030
It seems

16:15.460 --> 16:16.920
she really is a good child.

16:17.030 --> 16:17.960
Yes.

16:18.840 --> 16:20.900
Thank you for the compliment, Madam.

16:23.550 --> 16:25.410
Just stay here with peace of mind.

16:27.630 --> 16:28.270
Come.

16:29.790 --> 16:30.840
Thank you, Madam.

16:31.240 --> 16:32.270
Thank you, Lord.

16:33.000 --> 16:34.440
Thank you! Thank you!

16:34.510 --> 16:35.270
Thank you!

16:37.150 --> 16:39.240
Ronghua, I hope you are well.

16:39.750 --> 16:41.480
Our last hasty farewell

16:41.670 --> 16:43.270
still feels like yesterday.

16:43.720 --> 16:46.180
I wonder if you are doing well
in the Capital.

16:46.360 --> 16:48.760
The noble mansions have strict etiquette,

16:48.910 --> 16:50.870
so remember to be careful in your actions.

16:50.870 --> 16:52.360
But if someone bullies you,

16:52.360 --> 16:53.910
don't compromise.

16:54.120 --> 16:55.600
There is always a way out.

16:55.840 --> 16:57.750
I wish you all the best.

16:59.510 --> 17:00.870
Run slower,

17:01.080 --> 17:02.320
don't fall again.

17:03.790 --> 17:05.310
Slowly, slowly.

17:07.480 --> 17:08.589
Get up. Are you okay?

17:08.589 --> 17:10.510
My knee hurts! My knee!

17:10.510 --> 17:11.720
My knee!

17:12.000 --> 17:13.000
Are you okay?

17:13.000 --> 17:14.720
Don't sit on the ground, it's cold.

17:14.720 --> 17:15.680
It's cold.

17:15.960 --> 17:17.349
It's cold.

17:19.200 --> 17:20.310
Are you hurt?

17:20.960 --> 17:22.160
It hurts.

17:22.400 --> 17:23.510
It hurts.

17:27.480 --> 17:28.750
It doesn't hurt anymore.

17:28.750 --> 17:30.150
It doesn't hurt anymore.

17:32.270 --> 17:33.510
It doesn't hurt anymore.

17:33.510 --> 17:34.910
It doesn't hurt anymore.

17:35.510 --> 17:36.160
Drum!

17:36.240 --> 17:37.480
I want the drum.

17:37.750 --> 17:38.030
Drum—

17:38.030 --> 17:39.550
Don't move, I'll get it.

17:41.000 --> 17:41.720
Drum.

17:46.110 --> 17:46.680
Here.

17:49.070 --> 17:49.830
Drum!

17:50.240 --> 17:50.960
Drum!

17:51.480 --> 17:52.590
Drum!

17:53.240 --> 17:54.030
Drum!

17:56.440 --> 17:57.700
Have something to eat.

17:59.270 --> 17:59.830
Eat.

18:00.350 --> 18:01.110
Eat.

18:03.640 --> 18:04.480
Yum.

18:04.880 --> 18:05.830
Eat slowly.

18:06.200 --> 18:07.070
Don't choke.

18:09.960 --> 18:11.030
Eat slowly.

18:22.520 --> 18:23.890
Have some tea.

18:39.000 --> 18:39.680
Eat.

18:43.750 --> 18:44.510
Eat.

18:46.400 --> 18:47.960
It's not bad to be a fool.

18:49.070 --> 18:50.920
You can do whatever you want.

18:53.590 --> 18:54.590
Eat slowly.

18:56.640 --> 18:57.640
Slowly.

19:06.200 --> 19:06.830
Madam.

19:07.350 --> 19:08.010
Have a seat.

19:16.590 --> 19:18.510
Do you know why I called you here?

19:19.480 --> 19:21.080
Please enlighten me, Madam.

19:21.160 --> 19:22.510
I have seen how

19:22.510 --> 19:23.720
you interact with Qi.

19:24.270 --> 19:25.270
I ask myself:

19:26.110 --> 19:27.840
even as his biological mother,

19:28.640 --> 19:31.480
I can't help but despise a fool.

19:32.660 --> 19:34.350
Those who can endure this much

19:34.640 --> 19:36.170
are either deeply scheming

19:36.720 --> 19:38.050
with ulterior motives,

19:38.640 --> 19:40.920
or pure and innocent.

19:41.720 --> 19:42.550
Which one

19:42.920 --> 19:44.000
are you?

19:46.830 --> 19:49.690
Naturally, I have a motive
to be willing to take care

19:49.880 --> 19:52.280
of the Young Master
for the rest of his life.

19:52.750 --> 19:55.590
My father and two older brothers

19:55.920 --> 19:57.310
are in jail

19:58.380 --> 19:59.980
for bribing the magistrate.

20:00.330 --> 20:01.460
I came to the capital

20:02.030 --> 20:03.550
to save them.

20:04.960 --> 20:06.310
You are quite honest.

20:09.030 --> 20:10.070
Your family

20:10.070 --> 20:11.790
married you to a fool.

20:12.350 --> 20:14.920
Don't you resent it?

20:16.030 --> 20:17.110
Even a saint

20:18.000 --> 20:19.530
would have some complaints

20:20.720 --> 20:22.920
if met with a situation like this.

20:24.310 --> 20:25.920
But I must repay my parents

20:27.240 --> 20:28.510
for raising me.

20:31.070 --> 20:32.330
Foolish filial piety.

20:34.110 --> 20:35.550
Madam, as a mother,

20:36.270 --> 20:37.680
with a loving heart,

20:38.830 --> 20:40.720
naturally you'd hope to find someone

20:40.720 --> 20:42.350
who is willing to take care

20:43.310 --> 20:45.640
of the Young Master for the rest
of his life you can control.

20:45.640 --> 20:46.960
Someone like me

20:48.200 --> 20:49.790
is the most suitable.

20:53.310 --> 20:55.270
I've always wanted a daughter,

20:55.680 --> 20:57.030
but I couldn't get one.

20:57.680 --> 20:59.110
When you marry Qi

20:59.240 --> 21:00.590
and call me Mother,

21:01.640 --> 21:04.350
you'll be no different
from my own daughter.

21:06.720 --> 21:07.880
Thank you, ma'am.

21:11.000 --> 21:12.000
Thank you...

21:12.680 --> 21:13.510
Mother.

21:16.920 --> 21:17.590
Here.

21:39.440 --> 21:40.200
Father.

21:40.680 --> 21:41.480
At a time like this,

21:41.480 --> 21:42.680
aren't you anxious?

21:43.510 --> 21:45.370
What's there to be anxious about?

21:46.030 --> 21:47.350
You look like a loser.

21:49.310 --> 21:50.640
You useless thing.

21:50.790 --> 21:52.120
How can I not be anxious?

21:52.590 --> 21:53.790
Lord Zhao has fallen.

21:53.820 --> 21:55.550
What will happen to our family?

21:57.420 --> 21:59.280
Are we going to stay here forever?

22:04.260 --> 22:05.720
The fate of the Tian family

22:06.350 --> 22:08.610
depends on that official in the capital.

22:14.160 --> 22:14.960
Madam Hu,

22:15.550 --> 22:16.950
I've come to say goodbye.

22:24.300 --> 22:25.130
[To Magistrate He]

22:25.240 --> 22:26.700
This is the letter Madam Hu

22:26.790 --> 22:28.510
requested from Lord Xu.

22:29.240 --> 22:30.480
With this letter,

22:31.790 --> 22:35.050
my father and brothers
should be able to get out of trouble.

22:42.590 --> 22:43.720
Thank you, Madam...

22:45.480 --> 22:47.810
for saving the Tian family from disaster.

22:52.780 --> 22:53.540
Ronghua,

22:55.720 --> 22:57.440
when you stay in Hu's Mansion,

22:59.160 --> 23:01.360
you must take good care of your husband.

23:02.000 --> 23:03.790
Serve Madam well,

23:04.920 --> 23:07.680
and don't make her angry.
Understand?

23:15.400 --> 23:17.480
Madam, I entrust Ronghua

23:17.720 --> 23:19.110
to you.

23:19.830 --> 23:20.640
Don't worry.

23:22.240 --> 23:23.750
Ronghua is so obedient.

23:24.240 --> 23:25.160
In the future,

23:25.680 --> 23:26.880
I will certainly love her

23:26.880 --> 23:28.480
like my own daughter.

23:29.720 --> 23:30.750
Thank you, Madam.

23:35.000 --> 23:35.720
Mother,

23:37.790 --> 23:40.190
let me walk you back
to change your clothes.

24:08.140 --> 24:14.230
[Ronghua, I hope you are well.
Waiting for your reply, Li Zhen]

24:27.160 --> 24:28.070
My Lady,

24:28.310 --> 24:30.160
the food has been out for a while.

24:30.270 --> 24:31.330
It's getting cold.

24:31.510 --> 24:33.310
You should eat something first.

24:34.270 --> 24:36.510
I'm not hungry. Clear it away.

24:43.000 --> 24:43.790
My Lady,

24:44.550 --> 24:45.550
you've read these letters

24:45.550 --> 24:47.400
countless times.

24:47.440 --> 24:48.770
Would you like to reply?

25:44.510 --> 25:45.270
Lord He.

25:45.400 --> 25:46.110
Lord He.

25:47.240 --> 25:49.040
Master Tian, what a clever move.

25:49.520 --> 25:51.590
I have received
the letter from the capital,

25:51.590 --> 25:53.270
written by Lord Xu.

25:57.830 --> 26:00.240
Lord He, the Tian family
is really wrongly accused.

26:00.240 --> 26:01.240
Wrongly accused?

26:03.420 --> 26:06.200
The account books
confiscated from your Tian family

26:06.200 --> 26:09.730
completely does not match
the ink merchants' purchase orders.

26:10.930 --> 26:13.800
Your family is clearly using
the ink business

26:13.830 --> 26:16.790
to launder illicit money for Zhao Shen.

26:18.100 --> 26:20.100
Although Lord Xu has already

26:20.130 --> 26:21.550
shown some concern over this matter,

26:21.550 --> 26:23.020
the evidence is irrefutable.

26:23.020 --> 26:23.670
How could I

26:24.100 --> 26:25.870
bend the law for personal gain?

26:29.680 --> 26:31.550
You are absolutely right, Lord He.

26:31.550 --> 26:34.510
How could our Tian family
make things difficult for you?

26:34.510 --> 26:35.510
However, My Lord,

26:36.160 --> 26:38.400
our Tian family
was indeed deceived by a villain.

26:38.400 --> 26:39.830
My father is not fully literate.

26:39.830 --> 26:41.270
He mistakenly trusted the accountant,
Xu Chengde,

26:41.270 --> 26:43.530
and entrusted all business funds to him.

26:43.960 --> 26:44.890
We didn't expect

26:45.030 --> 26:46.640
that this man would collude with Zhao Shen

26:46.640 --> 26:48.100
and frame our Tian family.

26:49.270 --> 26:50.670
Since a mistake was made,

26:50.830 --> 26:52.980
someone has to take the responsibility.

26:52.980 --> 26:54.400
The Tian family will not tolerate it.

26:54.400 --> 26:56.750
Xu Chengde is entirely at your disposal.

27:01.830 --> 27:03.350
Eldest Young Master Tian,

27:04.160 --> 27:06.200
well played.

27:11.030 --> 27:12.590
The crime is established

27:13.000 --> 27:14.400
and the culprit is found.

27:14.680 --> 27:15.400
Tell me,

27:15.590 --> 27:17.960
how should I punish him?

27:19.920 --> 27:21.780
You are very thoughtful, My Lord.

27:22.110 --> 27:24.680
Our Tian family cannot shirk
our responsibility this time.

27:24.680 --> 27:26.830
We will definitely set an example
to warn others.

27:26.830 --> 27:29.270
Since a mistake was made,
we must accept the punishment.

27:29.270 --> 27:32.200
You can confiscate the 5,000 taels
of illicit money.

27:33.110 --> 27:34.750
As illicit money,

27:34.920 --> 27:37.440
confiscating it is only natural.

27:41.350 --> 27:42.270
My Lord,

27:43.030 --> 27:44.490
you are absolutely right.

27:46.400 --> 27:47.160
In addition,

27:47.640 --> 27:49.720
our Tian family will offer
another 1,000 taels of silver

27:49.720 --> 27:51.310
to the Huizhou government office

27:51.310 --> 27:53.830
as efforts to set an example
for operation of the ink business

27:53.830 --> 27:55.790
and restore integrity to the industry.

27:55.790 --> 27:58.720
We will have to trouble you
with this matter, Lord He,

27:58.750 --> 28:01.070
which will also
protect your good reputation.

28:01.070 --> 28:01.960
Right, My Lord?

28:02.270 --> 28:03.730
Eldest Young Master Tian,

28:04.310 --> 28:05.790
as someone this scheming,

28:06.960 --> 28:08.620
your talents are wasted here.

28:08.880 --> 28:10.410
You must be joking, My Lord.

28:10.680 --> 28:11.440
Master Tian.

28:12.270 --> 28:15.240
As the Prefect of Huizhou,

28:15.550 --> 28:17.080
I hope your Tian family will

28:17.480 --> 28:19.480
behave yourselves in the future.

28:20.350 --> 28:21.080
Definitely.

28:21.550 --> 28:23.010
Definitely, definitely.

28:34.240 --> 28:35.240
The Tian family's

28:35.790 --> 28:37.390
savings over all these years

28:37.790 --> 28:39.590
are gone just like that.

28:40.350 --> 28:41.000
Father.

28:42.590 --> 28:43.960
The only thing we can do now

28:43.960 --> 28:46.090
is to cut off our arm to save ourselves.

28:47.030 --> 28:48.480
Where there is life,

28:49.310 --> 28:50.590
there is hope.

28:53.030 --> 28:55.860
[Huizhou Prefecture Office]

28:58.590 --> 28:59.480
Tian Huai'an,

28:59.750 --> 29:00.480
what do you

29:00.510 --> 29:01.640
have to say?

29:02.830 --> 29:03.880
Prefect.

29:04.200 --> 29:05.730
I was momentarily confused

29:06.070 --> 29:07.510
and employed the wrong person.

29:07.510 --> 29:09.510
Zhao Shen is a shameless scoundrel.

29:10.240 --> 29:11.310
Xu Chengde

29:11.720 --> 29:12.790
looks honest,

29:13.070 --> 29:14.310
but he is actually an

29:14.350 --> 29:15.880
insatiably greedy person.

29:16.350 --> 29:18.550
The two of them secretly colluded

29:18.590 --> 29:19.830
over false accounts.

29:20.000 --> 29:20.790
I

29:20.880 --> 29:22.340
knew absolutely nothing.

29:22.720 --> 29:23.880
Master, you... you...

29:23.880 --> 29:24.590
My Lord.

29:24.640 --> 29:25.030
My Lord!

29:25.030 --> 29:25.880
Mr. Xu.

29:26.720 --> 29:29.180
You watched
the three of us siblings grow up.

29:29.680 --> 29:32.070
The Tian family has always
trusted you immensely.

29:32.070 --> 29:33.200
Your son

29:33.510 --> 29:34.480
and grandson

29:35.030 --> 29:36.510
both work at Tian Ink.

29:37.440 --> 29:38.960
Our family respects you as an elder

29:38.960 --> 29:40.200
and treats your family

29:40.200 --> 29:42.160
as if they were our own.

29:42.310 --> 29:42.750
How...

29:43.070 --> 29:44.160
How could you trap the Tian family

29:44.160 --> 29:46.110
in such an unjust position?

29:47.050 --> 29:48.140
Xu Chengde.

29:48.960 --> 29:51.640
Do you plead guilty
to colluding with Zhao Shen

29:51.880 --> 29:52.590
to cook

29:52.790 --> 29:53.680
the books?

29:54.830 --> 29:55.680
My Lord,

29:55.790 --> 29:56.590
I...

29:59.350 --> 29:59.830
I...

30:00.960 --> 30:02.790
I... I plead guilty.

30:03.920 --> 30:05.160
I plead guilty.

30:06.070 --> 30:07.510
I plead guilty.

30:08.920 --> 30:09.640
My Lord.

30:10.240 --> 30:12.270
As the master of Tian Ink,

30:12.680 --> 30:13.940
I know I am at fault too.

30:13.960 --> 30:17.000
I voluntarily resign as master of Tian Ink

30:17.240 --> 30:18.100
as punishment.

30:18.350 --> 30:19.240
From now on,

30:19.350 --> 30:22.150
I will never
enter the Huizhou ink industry again.

30:23.070 --> 30:23.790
Very well.

30:24.110 --> 30:25.110
Since Tian Huai'an

30:25.110 --> 30:26.480
has penalized himself

30:26.550 --> 30:28.350
and withdrawn
from the Huizhou ink industry,

30:28.350 --> 30:29.640
I hereby sentence

30:29.920 --> 30:30.680
the criminal

30:31.000 --> 30:32.310
Xu Chengde

30:32.350 --> 30:33.790
to exile in the North.

30:34.070 --> 30:37.030
The Tian family is to return
5,000 taels of illicit money.

30:37.030 --> 30:38.920
The 3 Tian family men

30:39.070 --> 30:39.870
are acquitted

30:40.000 --> 30:40.790
and released.

30:40.790 --> 30:41.790
Court dismissed!

30:41.880 --> 30:42.680
Lord He.

30:43.350 --> 30:45.480
There is one thing I don't understand.

30:45.720 --> 30:47.960
The Tian family colluded with Zhao Shen

30:47.960 --> 30:49.270
in corruption.

30:50.660 --> 30:52.750
Why were they acquitted and released?

30:52.750 --> 30:53.510
Master Qi.

30:54.110 --> 30:55.750
The witnesses and material evidence
all point to

30:55.750 --> 30:57.400
Zhao Shen's corruption.

30:57.830 --> 31:00.000
His accountant, Xu Chengde,

31:00.000 --> 31:01.160
has confessed

31:01.160 --> 31:03.510
that he was the one
who colluded with Zhao Shen.

31:03.510 --> 31:05.310
The Tian family was unaware of it.

31:05.310 --> 31:06.240
Lord He,

31:06.880 --> 31:08.080
do you really believe

31:09.480 --> 31:10.310
such a claim?

31:14.960 --> 31:15.880
Master Qi.

31:16.230 --> 31:17.510
Judging a case

31:17.750 --> 31:19.070
requires evidence.

31:19.480 --> 31:20.270
Even if

31:20.960 --> 31:21.920
there might be

31:22.160 --> 31:23.270
other claims,

31:24.000 --> 31:25.160
a final conviction

31:25.270 --> 31:26.800
still depends on evidence.

31:27.070 --> 31:28.440
I doubt your judgement

31:28.440 --> 31:29.750
will convince the public.

31:29.750 --> 31:31.480
As a local magistrate,

31:32.150 --> 31:34.030
you should plead for the people

31:34.480 --> 31:35.750
and be just and incorruptible.

31:35.750 --> 31:37.240
As I just said,

31:38.440 --> 31:39.510
I only judge cases

31:39.640 --> 31:40.700
based on evidence.

31:40.830 --> 31:41.550
And

31:41.880 --> 31:43.240
it has always been so.

31:44.440 --> 31:45.240
Lord He.

31:46.510 --> 31:49.040
Is it truly impossible
to overturn this case?

31:50.160 --> 31:51.070
Master Qi,

31:51.110 --> 31:52.440
figure it out yourself.

31:55.240 --> 31:56.440
I advise you

31:57.720 --> 31:58.960
not to cause trouble

31:59.270 --> 32:00.200
for Marshal Qi.

32:03.590 --> 32:05.190
Sorry to bother you, Lord He.

32:08.200 --> 32:12.240
The Emperor's edict to the ink merchants
and citizens of Huizhou.

32:12.590 --> 32:13.350
Now,

32:13.750 --> 32:16.160
I seek the finest ink in the world

32:16.310 --> 32:18.270
for the exclusive use
of the imperial court.

32:18.270 --> 32:20.000
All Tribute Ink

32:20.030 --> 32:22.400
judged as top quality by the court

32:22.440 --> 32:23.840
will be heavily rewarded

32:24.070 --> 32:27.680
to encourage the ink trade
to continue improving its skills.

32:28.160 --> 32:28.790
I

32:28.880 --> 32:32.150
know there are many scholars
and men of letters in the world—

32:32.150 --> 32:34.550
some may possess precious ink,

32:34.590 --> 32:36.400
or have unique skills.

32:36.680 --> 32:39.030
I hope you all understand my intentions,

32:39.030 --> 32:40.750
and enthusiastically offer ink,

32:40.750 --> 32:43.640
to jointly support
this grand literary event

32:43.640 --> 32:45.590
and leave a legacy for eternity.

32:46.160 --> 32:47.160
That's the edict—

32:47.400 --> 32:49.240
in the 42nd year of Jiajing.

32:58.830 --> 32:59.750
Long live...

33:00.000 --> 33:01.160
His Majesty.

33:01.200 --> 33:02.160
Long live

33:02.200 --> 33:03.790
His Majesty.

33:09.720 --> 33:10.440
Everyone.

33:10.880 --> 33:13.000
The Emperor's grace is vast.

33:13.400 --> 33:14.400
This time's

33:14.880 --> 33:16.510
Tribute Ink selection

33:16.920 --> 33:18.200
allows for every family with prized ink

33:18.200 --> 33:19.270
to join.

33:19.920 --> 33:20.960
All those who are shortlisted

33:20.960 --> 33:23.480
will be posted on the notice board

33:23.510 --> 33:24.440
in Sibao Street.

33:24.830 --> 33:25.830
As you all know,

33:25.880 --> 33:28.280
the right to produce
Tribute Ink in Huizhou

33:28.400 --> 33:30.830
has fallen into the hands
of others for years.

33:30.830 --> 33:32.090
This is an opportunity

33:32.350 --> 33:33.790
we cannot miss again.

33:34.480 --> 33:35.550
Whether we can

33:35.920 --> 33:38.550
get the Tribute Ink rights back...

33:41.030 --> 33:42.750
depends on all of you.

33:45.750 --> 33:48.410
Sacrificing his daughter
for personal gain...

33:49.550 --> 33:50.920
How shameless!

33:52.790 --> 33:54.830
Let's stop here.

33:55.960 --> 33:57.720
Lord Xu is the Grand Secretariat.

33:57.720 --> 34:00.050
This matter involves the imperial court.

34:00.270 --> 34:02.830
Lord Xu is the one
protecting the Tian family now.

34:02.830 --> 34:04.200
If you keep pushing,

34:04.200 --> 34:06.330
you'll be openly challenging Lord Xu.

34:06.550 --> 34:08.280
Think about your own identity.

34:08.280 --> 34:09.590
If you go against Lord Xu,

34:09.590 --> 34:11.719
how do you expect General to handle it?

34:25.710 --> 34:27.400
Let me remind you once more:

34:29.150 --> 34:31.880
the Tian family has been cleared
of their charges

34:31.960 --> 34:33.510
and regained their qualification

34:33.510 --> 34:35.110
to run for the Tribute Ink.

34:36.000 --> 34:38.710
If the Tian family wins the right,

34:39.400 --> 34:40.800
the orders for Hui Ink

34:40.880 --> 34:42.880
will all start going to them.

34:43.150 --> 34:46.360
Your dividends in Li Ink
will definitely be affected.

34:46.840 --> 34:48.400
Brother, you must know.

34:48.800 --> 34:51.250
Your six-month deadline
with General is approaching.

34:51.250 --> 34:52.860
If it really comes to that,

34:53.000 --> 34:54.510
your plans in the ink industry

34:54.510 --> 34:56.040
will be completely ruined.

34:56.840 --> 34:57.880
You'd better think about

34:57.880 --> 34:59.940
what's the most important thing now.

35:00.480 --> 35:01.740
You are right, Sister.

35:05.590 --> 35:07.440
I was too impulsive just now.

35:08.590 --> 35:10.250
The most urgent task right now

35:10.760 --> 35:11.820
is the Tribute Ink.

35:16.400 --> 35:17.800
So what's your plan?

35:18.670 --> 35:22.230
Even though Lord Xu
can interfere in official affairs,

35:22.480 --> 35:24.480
he might not be able to control

35:24.480 --> 35:26.140
the Tribute Ink competition.

35:26.840 --> 35:28.480
The Tian family is clinging to Lord Xu

35:28.480 --> 35:30.960
just to find a bigger backer.

35:31.320 --> 35:32.650
As long as it's a backer,

35:33.630 --> 35:35.560
it has to be supported with silver.

35:35.590 --> 35:37.030
Then I'll find a way

35:37.550 --> 35:39.190
to cut off their way of making money

35:39.190 --> 35:40.320
through Tribute Ink.

35:40.320 --> 35:42.320
Over time,

35:42.360 --> 35:43.620
when the money is gone,

35:43.920 --> 35:45.070
this Lord Xu

35:45.710 --> 35:48.310
naturally won't help
the Tian family anymore.

35:50.550 --> 35:53.070
I have to find a way to win
the rights to the Tribute Ink.

35:53.070 --> 35:55.600
First, that'll help
with the military funds.

35:56.190 --> 35:56.800
Second,

35:57.150 --> 36:00.280
to cut off the Tian family's retreat.

36:04.550 --> 36:05.960
I'm relieved that you

36:07.110 --> 36:08.230
can think this far.

36:16.190 --> 36:18.760
My Lord, you just said congratulations,

36:19.440 --> 36:20.440
but I wonder

36:21.000 --> 36:23.660
what's there to congratulate
the Li family for.

36:25.320 --> 36:26.110
Old Madam.

36:26.590 --> 36:28.400
The Tribute Ink selection this time—

36:28.400 --> 36:30.330
the timing, location, and people—

36:30.400 --> 36:32.280
are all in favor of the Li family.

36:32.750 --> 36:34.480
That's worth congratulating.

36:37.000 --> 36:37.840
Lord Yan.

36:38.030 --> 36:39.760
The Li family is still thinking

36:39.760 --> 36:41.620
about the Tribute Ink selection.

36:41.710 --> 36:43.910
We haven't officially registered yet.

36:43.960 --> 36:45.070
Is there

36:45.590 --> 36:47.320
some misunderstanding?

36:47.670 --> 36:49.030
There is no misunderstanding.

36:49.030 --> 36:50.590
There is no misunderstanding.

36:50.590 --> 36:52.920
I was involved in the restoration
of the ancient lacquer-soot ink

36:52.920 --> 36:53.710
from the

36:53.760 --> 36:56.440
very beginning to the end.

36:56.710 --> 36:58.110
At the ink testing event,

36:58.400 --> 37:01.800
I saw its brilliance with my own eyes.

37:01.920 --> 37:02.800
Therefore,

37:02.880 --> 37:04.150
I selected the ancient lacquer-soot ink

37:04.150 --> 37:06.360
as the primary selection ink

37:06.670 --> 37:09.440
of the Li family personally.

37:10.630 --> 37:11.880
Such good ink

37:12.030 --> 37:13.760
will definitely be on the list.

37:14.710 --> 37:15.920
As for

37:16.230 --> 37:17.560
the final selection...

37:19.280 --> 37:20.110
Lord Yan,

37:20.320 --> 37:21.320
I have been

37:21.440 --> 37:22.510
working hard to research and improve

37:22.510 --> 37:25.700
the Yunsong Ink in recent years.

37:26.280 --> 37:27.550
I am confident

37:27.630 --> 37:29.400
to participate
in the Tribute Ink selection

37:29.400 --> 37:31.070
with the new Yunsong Ink.

37:31.190 --> 37:32.510
The new Yunsong Ink?

37:32.510 --> 37:33.150
Yes.

37:33.360 --> 37:35.400
There must've been a huge improvement.

37:35.400 --> 37:36.280
Where is the ink?

37:36.280 --> 37:37.810
It is still being improved.

37:37.880 --> 37:39.280
I believe it will be

37:39.960 --> 37:41.630
finished soon.

37:41.960 --> 37:43.710
How many days is soon?

37:51.150 --> 37:52.510
That's inappropriate.

37:53.480 --> 37:55.110
This Tribute Ink selection

37:55.590 --> 37:57.450
is not a trivial matter after all.

37:57.760 --> 37:59.230
If you sign up

37:59.320 --> 38:01.440
with an unfinished ink,

38:02.070 --> 38:03.730
it's a little inappropriate.

38:04.510 --> 38:05.230
Old Madam.

38:06.320 --> 38:06.980
Have a look.

38:10.510 --> 38:11.760
Please.

38:13.320 --> 38:14.520
Everyone's familiar

38:14.590 --> 38:15.880
with this ink, right?

38:16.280 --> 38:19.320
This is Miss Li Zhen's Fu Jin Ink.

38:21.230 --> 38:22.710
To be honest,

38:23.150 --> 38:25.880
this piece of Fu Jin Ink from Miss Li Zhen

38:26.410 --> 38:28.760
cured my daughter's chronic disease.

38:30.840 --> 38:31.710
An ink

38:31.960 --> 38:33.630
that can cure people

38:34.320 --> 38:36.280
winning the Tribute Ink selection

38:36.880 --> 38:38.480
is inevitable, isn't it?

38:38.880 --> 38:39.710
But, My Lord,

38:39.800 --> 38:41.130
although this Fu Jin Ink

38:41.800 --> 38:42.880
is great...

38:44.480 --> 38:46.880
it is not an ink of the Li family.

38:47.230 --> 38:48.360
Lord Yan,

38:49.360 --> 38:50.760
I am extremely grateful

38:51.030 --> 38:52.840
for your painstaking efforts.

38:53.230 --> 38:55.280
The Eighth Branch to which Zhen belongs

38:55.280 --> 38:57.030
has long been expelled from the family.

38:57.030 --> 38:59.510
She is now the Head of New Li Ink.

38:59.920 --> 39:01.050
She has nothing to do

39:01.590 --> 39:03.190
with Li Ink.

39:06.280 --> 39:08.320
I have also heard
about the Tribute Ink turmoil

39:08.320 --> 39:10.450
and the expulsion of the Eighth Branch

39:10.710 --> 39:13.590
of the Li family.

39:14.550 --> 39:16.190
But that was in the past.

39:17.000 --> 39:18.630
The past is the past,

39:18.670 --> 39:20.360
now is now—

39:20.440 --> 39:22.150
times have changed.

39:24.510 --> 39:25.360
I see

39:25.440 --> 39:27.230
Miss Li Zhen has been cooperating closely

39:27.230 --> 39:29.110
with the Li family recently.

39:29.280 --> 39:30.590
This is a good thing.

39:31.480 --> 39:32.400
Why not

39:32.420 --> 39:34.880
take advantage
of the Tribute Ink selection

39:35.510 --> 39:36.920
to combine the New Li and main Li

39:36.920 --> 39:38.360
into one.

39:38.760 --> 39:41.480
That'd be a great thing
to the ink industry.

39:41.480 --> 39:43.000
Why not, right?

39:43.480 --> 39:44.230
My Lord,

39:44.960 --> 39:46.800
Li Ink is an expert at pine soot.

39:47.510 --> 39:49.400
In the past,

39:49.590 --> 39:52.520
we'd submit pine soot ink
for Tribute Ink selection.

39:53.320 --> 39:55.320
To change the type of ink so abruptly

39:55.550 --> 39:56.710
is a little...

39:57.110 --> 39:59.030
I understand

39:59.150 --> 40:00.810
everything you say and think.

40:00.880 --> 40:01.710
It's fine.

40:01.960 --> 40:02.920
It's fine.

40:03.550 --> 40:06.190
Don't be constrained
by these minor details.

40:06.630 --> 40:07.670
To be honest,

40:08.150 --> 40:10.760
I have already sent for Miss Li Zhen.

40:11.230 --> 40:12.840
When she arrives,

40:12.920 --> 40:14.840
let's settle this matter here.

40:15.800 --> 40:17.860
Please rescind your order, Lord Yan!

40:27.150 --> 40:27.960
Lord Yan,

40:28.000 --> 40:29.030
I thank you

40:29.030 --> 40:30.480
for your appreciation.

40:31.190 --> 40:32.710
However, this ancient lacquer-soot ink

40:32.710 --> 40:35.040
has nothing to do
with New Li Ink Workshop.

40:35.190 --> 40:36.030
Before this,

40:36.030 --> 40:38.490
I was just an ink maker
hired by the Li family.

40:39.070 --> 40:40.360
As for this Fu Jin Ink,

40:41.070 --> 40:43.360
I had no intention
of submitting it for selection.

40:43.360 --> 40:45.400
My ambition does not lie in Tribute Ink.

40:45.400 --> 40:47.060
I ask for your understanding.

40:47.150 --> 40:48.400
Miss Li Zhen,

40:48.510 --> 40:50.000
what do you mean by this?

40:51.760 --> 40:52.960
Rights to Tribute Ink

40:53.320 --> 40:55.070
is what an ink maker

40:55.440 --> 40:57.000
seeks all their life.

40:57.320 --> 40:59.230
You say your ambition does not lie there—

40:59.230 --> 40:59.880
very well.

41:00.110 --> 41:01.320
Tell me,

41:01.400 --> 41:03.400
where does your ambition lie, then?

41:03.920 --> 41:05.710
I am content to be able to

41:06.150 --> 41:07.590
open New Li Ink Workshop,

41:07.630 --> 41:08.800
make ink,

41:09.030 --> 41:10.290
and support my family.

41:10.840 --> 41:13.170
I dare not aim for
the right to Tribute Ink.

41:14.030 --> 41:15.030
Miss Li Zhen.

41:16.000 --> 41:17.280
Your abilities

41:17.550 --> 41:18.510
and courage—

41:19.000 --> 41:20.920
I have seen them for myself.

41:21.070 --> 41:23.400
You are by no means
a person lacking ambition.

41:23.400 --> 41:25.000
There's no need to be modest.

41:25.110 --> 41:26.550
I am not being modest.

41:28.190 --> 41:30.440
Our Eighth Branch's
expulsion from the family,

41:30.440 --> 41:31.550
my father's death,

41:32.070 --> 41:33.840
and how my entire family was left
to wander around City Gate Lane

41:33.840 --> 41:35.570
was all because of Tribute Ink.

41:35.960 --> 41:37.150
Although I love ink

41:37.510 --> 41:38.440
and also consider making ink

41:38.440 --> 41:39.770
as a lifelong ambition,

41:40.320 --> 41:41.320
I don't want to...

41:43.190 --> 41:45.850
have anything to do with Tribute Ink
ever again.

41:49.280 --> 41:51.150
I beg for your understanding, Lord Yan.

41:51.150 --> 41:52.030
Li Zhen!

41:58.320 --> 42:00.630
What a lot of excuses.

42:00.960 --> 42:03.440
What a lot of difficulties.

42:03.670 --> 42:06.710
Are my good intentions
causing a bad thing instead?

42:07.150 --> 42:08.610
Please calm down, My Lord.

42:08.960 --> 42:10.320
In that case,

42:12.920 --> 42:15.280
I'll put it bluntly!

42:15.440 --> 42:16.710
No matter what happened,

42:16.710 --> 42:18.590
Huizhou must win

42:18.710 --> 42:20.400
the Tribute Ink selection!

42:20.510 --> 42:23.360
I will personally
present it to His Majesty!

42:24.280 --> 42:25.400
Your Li family

42:25.710 --> 42:26.630
can't refuse!

42:27.110 --> 42:27.760
Everyone,

42:28.800 --> 42:30.960
know your place.
